==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 21.33 seconds<sup>640f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 4.67 seconds<sup>140f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

